'-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' Author:        Pawel Ligezka
' Creation date: 2026-08-11
' Parameters:    lngClipDepth As Long
' Returns:       String
' Description:   Closes the Oracle graphics-state scopes opened for a cell.
'                Multiple scopes remain supported for OLD-compatible nested clips.
